abstract: >-
  An unrefereed theorem candidate, relative to named classification results,
  proving an all-degree classification of complex polynomial phases with
  fixed seed dx and cyclic rank at most three and classifying every proper
  rank-preserving outer extension. Scoped Lean and separate exact CAS controls
  accompany the written proof; external reproduction and peer review remain
  outstanding.
